          "c": "我星期二同星期三上班，星期四同星期五放假。",
          "j": "ngo5 sing1 kei4 ji6 tung4 sing1 kei4 saam1 soeng5 baan1, sing1 kei4 sei3 tung4 sing1 kei4 ng5 fong3 gaa3.",
          "e": "I work Tuesday and Wednesday, and have Thursday and Friday off.",
